# keelstackhq decisions

Settled decisions that apply across repos. Follow them. To change one, open a PR here
(see README). Hard limit: 60 lines; reasoning lives in `decisions/`, read it only when needed.
Scope `all orgs` also applies outside keelstackhq (channel piece `portable` imports only those).

{% if "portable" in pieces %}Portable subset: only decisions with scope `all orgs`; keep your org's own in its own decisions repo (README).

